{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_vrtx_01EzYkrWZGXn9jZLso1nNAuJ","type":"tool_result","content":"60\t2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-005: Design a generative QA assistant for your company's knowledge base — ACL-aware hybrid RAG pipeline (Confluence/Notion connectors, webhook freshness, BM25+dense RRF fusion, cross-encoder rerank, grounding prompt T=0 with citations), model tiering (GPT-4o-mini vs GPT-4o), RAGAS golden-dataset eval gate, deflection-rate production SLO\n61\t2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-006: System processing huge PDF reports — structure-aware extraction (PyMuPDF/Textract), global metadata injection (currency units as chunk fields + generation preamble), parent-child chunking (1024/256 tokens), table-as-unit handling, overlap windows\n62\t2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-007: How efficiently generate and store embeddings for products and queries? — offline batch pipeline (2048/call async, OpenAI ~$20/5M products), Pinecone/Qdrant vector storage with metadata sidecar, CDC-driven incremental updates via Debezium+Kafka, same model rule for index vs query, MRL dimension truncation and self-hosting break-even\n63\t2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-008: How handle hallucination when no information is found in context? — defense-in-depth stack: cosine-similarity retrieval gate (θ≈0.70 short-circuits before LLM call), grounding prompt at T=0 with explicit abstention instruction, RAGAS faithfulness post-check (<0.8 → replace with canned response), production monitoring of abstention vs hallucination rates separately\n64\t2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-009: What RAG projects have you worked on? — STAR+Tradeoffs walkthrough framework, parent-child chunking + hybrid RRF + Cohere rerank example, deflection-rate failure arc, 3 concrete pitfalls about tool-naming vs tradeoff ownership"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"216a8152-360d-44cf-a589-f844cc5